@SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5020

### Criar tarefa
# @name createTask
POST {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Estudar C#",
	"description": "Capítulo 3",
	"status": "EmProgresso",
	"dueDate": "{{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 5 d}}"
}

### Criar tarefa sem data de vencimento
POST {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Ler documentação do EF Core"
}

### Listar todas as tarefas
GET {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks

### Listar por status
GET {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?status=EmProgresso

### Listar por intervalo de vencimento (mostra quantas tarefas sem data ficaram de fora)
GET {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?dueDateFrom={{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd"}}&dueDateTo={{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 30 d}}

### Buscar a tarefa criada
GET {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}

### Editar a tarefa criada (PUT substitui todos os campos)
PUT {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Estudar C# e EF Core",
	"description": null,
	"status": "Concluida",
	"dueDate": null
}

### Excluir a tarefa criada
DELETE {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/{{createTask.response.body.$.id}}

### Erro 400: título vazio
POST {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": ""
}

### Erro 400: vencimento no passado
POST {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Tarefa atrasada",
	"dueDate": "{{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" -1 d}}"
}

### Erro 400: filtro com data inicial maior que a final
GET {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?dueDateFrom={{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd" 10 d}}&dueDateTo={{$datetime "yyyy-MM-dd"}}

### Erro 404: tarefa inexistente
GET {{SadaTaskManager.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
